  "title": "Consumer setup step 1: finish self-validation",
  "description": "Step 1 of the consumer setup sequence. Finish making \
GregorStocks/agent-issues itself a first-class consumer of its own local issue \
workflow before changing external repositories. The initial AGENTS guidance \
